{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0118-s005", "text": "De gemensamma examensdelarna är till nytta när man söker till fortsatta studier.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-yrkesutbildning/narration/resume-20261103T042047562696+0000-6/hb-c08-u0118-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.244625850340136, "peak": 0.326751708984375, "generation_seconds": 21.38988835690543, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0119-s001", "text": "När studierna börjar gör skolan upp en personlig utvecklingsplan för kunnandet (PUK) för varje studerande.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-yrkesutbildning/narration/resume-20261103T042047562696+0000-6/hb-c08-u0119-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.543401360544218, "peak": 0.29248046875, "generation_seconds": 29.3877513660118, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0119-s002", "text": "Den är den studerandes individuella studieplan.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-yrkesutbildning/narration/resume-20261103T042047562696+0000-6/hb-c08-u0119-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.31891156462585, "peak": 0.286651611328125, "generation_seconds": 12.400966947898269, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0119-s003", "text": "Om den studerande studerar inom specialundervisning, gör skolan också upp en individuell plan för hur undervisningen ska ordnas (IP) för hen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-yrkesutbildning/narration/resume-20261103T042047562696+0000-6/hb-c08-u0119-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.26013605442177, "peak": 0.264801025390625, "generation_seconds": 38.11098773800768, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0120-s001", "text": "Den studerande deltar aktivt i planeringen av sina studier och får studiehandledning under studiernas gång.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-yrkesutbildning/narration/resume-20261103T042047562696+0000-6/hb-c08-u0120-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.264761904761905, "peak": 0.25286865234375, "generation_seconds": 28.824341295985505, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0120-s002", "text": "Studiehandledningen är särskilt viktig för studerande som har studiesvårigheter eller utmaningar med livshanteringen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-yrkesutbildning/narration/resume-20261103T042047562696+0000-6/hb-c08-u0120-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.100680272108843, "peak": 0.253143310546875, "generation_seconds": 37.173261335119605, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0120-s003", "text": "Studiehandledningen hjälper den studerande att slutföra sina studier, stöder hen och stärker utvecklingen av hens yrkesskicklighet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-yrkesutbildning/narration/resume-20261103T042047562696+0000-6/hb-c08-u0120-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.215238095238096, "peak": 0.337921142578125, "generation_seconds": 40.27880988805555, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0121-s001", "text": "Inom yrkesinriktade grundexamina bedöms den studerandes kunnande vanligtvis genom prov som genomförs på en arbetsplats under perioder av lärande i arbete.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-yrkesutbildning/narration/resume-20261103T042047562696+0000-6/hb-c08-u0121-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 13.235374149659863, "peak": 0.397735595703125, "generation_seconds": 47.77429165202193, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
